cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GLM: Thermal Use Module — Integrating heat extraction into the General Lake Model"
abstract: >
  Extension of the General Lake Model (GLM) to simulate thermal use via heat
  pump systems. Implements thermal exchange between a lake and a heat pump,
  including physical constraints, subdaily processing, and diagnostic outputs
  (CSV + NetCDF).
